{"step_index":859,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T02:02:50Z","thinking":"Mission elements are highlighted with yellow, borders are a darker shade. Callout boxes use white, with gray borders and dark text, prefixed with message types. Heart symbols use pink/red.\n\n\nThe user's request explicitly requires the original design theme for all flowcharts, not the neon cyberpunk style. This necessitates reverting the design parameters to the original color scheme, encompassing mission elements, borders, callouts, heart symbols, and speedrun badges. The script must be updated to write the six specified flowcharts with the correct design parameters.\n\n\nInitial focus is on verifying the design helpers to ensure consistent visual style. Each chapter needs consistent components: background color, mission elements (yellow with dark borders), callouts (white with gray borders and text), heart symbols (pink/red), and side elements. The code must be adapted to use the correct color codes and shapes for each component, ensuring that the mission elements use rounded rectangles (e.g., using `FancyBboxPatch`) for the visual consistency.\n\n\nVerifying the visual style for speedrun badges involves setting emerald green, a lighter green border, a vibrant green title (prefixed with a lightning bolt), and a pale text. Ending cards require specific color settings for each ending scenario. Ensuring orthogonality and clear labels for stage bridges prevents arrow overlaps.\n\nThoroughly reviewing Chapter 1 content, it appears the header, subtitle, missions, and track structure are correctly formatted with parallel layouts, decision diamonds, mailboxes, and corrected flow from Missions 1 to 18.\n\n\nI'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nVerifying the visual structure for Chapter 2, Stage 2's missions 29-37 are confirmed with the correct parenthetical descriptions, parallel layouts, decision diamonds, and mailbox icons. Stage 3 (missions 38-40) includes the expected speedrun badge with dual character switching. Stage 4 (missions 41-44) shows the planned shootout and climax orange box.\n\nChapter 3's header and subtitle are correctly formatted, confirming the Vice City setting. Linear missions 45-50 are laid out according to specifications. Initial focus is Strand 1, starting with mission 51, and mission 52 for Tyrone's plotline.\n\n\nAnalyzing Chapter 3's Strand structure reveals three concurrent tracks leading to the heist planning stage. Strand 2 (Top Billing, Boobie Time, First Impressions), Strand 3 (Car Service, Caught Slipping, Crosstown Traffic, Credit Check, Steal Zorrusso), and the Heist Scope Out convergence (Sinfrontera National Bank) are correctly structured. A speedrun tip to minimize cooldown is validated.\n\nChapter 3's concurrent Heist Prep pipeline includes three tracks: Safecracker, Explosives, and Codes & Van, each with specific missions. A speedrun badge highlights a tower skip. The climax, mission 70, is confirmed with the specified orange box and critical speedrun warning. Chapter 4's structure includes header, subtitle, and four stages (Beachhead & Abe's $75k Gate, Syndicate & Corporate Operations).\n\n\nAnalyzing Chapter 4's structure confirms Stage 2 (Watch It) with missions 80-82 correctly formatted and Stage 3 (Dre'Quan Climax & Airport Recon) with missions 83-91. Stage 4 (VCIA Cargo Heist & Point of No Return) missions 92-95 show the climax orange box and dark red/orange \"Point of No Return\" badge, along with a Chapter 5 transition badge.\n\nChapter 5 is structured with a header, subtitle, and missions 96-102. The presence of a decision diamond/fork indicates the branching ending structure. Confirmation of three branching endings includes a speedrun route (Ending B) highlighted by a green speedrun badge.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.patches as patches\nimport os\nimport shutil\n\n# Directories\nWORKSPACE_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\"\nDOWNLOADS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\"\nANTIGRAV_DL_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\antigravity_version\"\nANTIGRAV_WS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\output\\antigravity_version\"\nARTIFACT_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\"\n\n# Classic Ground-Truth Theme Colors (Matching image_1188e9.jpg & GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.jpg)\nBG_COLOR = \"#33363b\"          # Slate-gray background\nCARD_BG_NORMAL = \"#fef08a\"    # Warm cream / yellow\nCARD_BORDER_NORMAL = \"#ca8a04\"# Golden yellow border\nCARD_BG_CLIMAX = \"#ffedd5\"    # Warm peach / orange\nCARD_BORDER_CLIMAX = \"#ea580c\"# Deep orange border\nTEXT_COLOR = \"#1c1917\"        # Dark charcoal / black text\nSUBTEXT_COLOR = \"#44403c\"     # Muted charcoal subtext\n\ndef draw_mission(ax, x, y, w, h, title, subtitle=\"\", is_climax=False, is_gate=False, font_size=8.5):\n    bg = CARD_BG_CLIMAX if is_climax else CARD_BG_NORMAL\n    border = CARD_BORDER_CLIMAX if is_climax else CARD_BORDER_NORMAL\n    lw = 2.0 if (is_climax or is_gate) else 1.2\n    \n    rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (x, y), w, h,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.10\",\n        linewidth=lw,\n        edgecolor=border,\n        facecolor=bg,\n        zorder=3\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    \n    ty = y + h/2 + 0.13 if subtitle else y + h/2\n    ax.text(x + w/2, ty, title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=TEXT_COLOR, zorder=4)\n    if subtitle:\n        ax.text(x + w/2, y + 0.20, subtitle, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size-1.8, color=SUBTEXT_COLOR, zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_callout(ax, x, y, w, h, text, icon_type=\"text\", font_size=7.2):\n    rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (x, y), w, h,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n        linewidth=1.0,\n        edgecolor=\"#71717a\",\n        facecolor=\"#ffffff\",\n        zorder=3\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    \n    prefix = \"\"\n    if icon_type == \"phone\":\n        prefix = \"[CALL] \"\n    elif icon_type == \"text\":\n        prefix = \"[MSG] \"\n    elif icon_type == \"mailbox\":\n        prefix = \"[MAILBOX] \"\n    elif icon_type == \"cash\":\n        prefix = \"[$] \"\n        \n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, prefix + text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\" if icon_type in [\"phone\", \"cash\"] else \"normal\", color=\"#09090b\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_heart(ax, x, y, w, h, text, skip_label=\"[ANY% SKIP]\", font_size=7.0):\n    rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (x, y), w, h,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n        linewidth=1.2,\n        edgecolor=\"#f43f5e\",\n        facecolor=\"#ffe4e6\",\n        zorder=3\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    t = \"♥ \" + text\n    if skip_label:\n        t += \"\\n\" + skip_label\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#9f1239\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_side(ax, x, y, w, h, text, font_size=7.0):\n    rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (x, y), w, h,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n        linewidth=1.2,\n        edgecolor=\"#a855f7\",\n        facecolor=\"#f3e8ff\",\n        zorder=3\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    t = text + \"\\n[OPTIONAL / SKIP]\"\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, color=\"#581c87\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_diamond(ax, cx, cy, rx, ry, text, font_size=6.8):\n    pts = [[cx, cy + ry], [cx + rx, cy], [cx, cy - ry], [cx - rx, cy]]\n    poly = patches.Polygon(pts, closed=True, linewidth=1.4, edgecolor=\"#cbd5e1\", facecolor=\"#ffffff\", zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(poly)\n    ax.text(cx, cy, text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#0f172a\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_speedrun_badge(ax, x, y, w, h, title, note, font_size=6.8):\n    rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (x, y), w, h,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n        linewidth=1.4,\n        edgecolor=\"#10b981\",\n        facecolor=\"#064e3b\",\n        zorder=3\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h - 0.22, \"⚡ \" + title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size+0.6, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#34d399\", zorder=4)\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2 - 0.1, note, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, color=\"#ecfdf5\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_arrow(ax, p1, p2, color=\"#ffffff\", lw=1.2, rad=0.0):\n    conn = f\"arc3,rad={rad}\" if rad != 0 else \"arc3,rad=0\"\n    ax.annotate(\n        \"\",\n        xy=p2, xytext=p1,\n        arrowprops=dict(\n            arrowstyle=\"->,head_width=0.28,head_length=0.38\",\n            color=color,\n            lw=lw,\n            shrinkA=3,\n            shrinkB=3,\n            connectionstyle=conn\n        ),\n        zorder=2\n    )\n\ndef copy_to_all(filename):\n    src = os.path.join(ARTIFACT_DIR, filename)\n    targets = [\n        os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, filename),\n        os.path.join(DOWNLOADS_DIR, filename),\n        os.path.join(ANTIGRAV_DL_DIR, filename),\n        os.path.join(ANTIGRAV_WS_DIR, filename),\n    ]\n    for dst in targets:\n        os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(dst), exist_ok=True)\n        shutil.copyfile(src, dst)\n    print(f\"Propagated {filename} to all locations.\")\n\ndef setup_header(ax, title, subtitle, max_x, y_top):\n    ax.text(max_x / 2, y_top, title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=16, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#ffffff\")\n    ax.text(max_x / 2, y_top - 0.5, subtitle, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=9.5, color=\"#fde047\")\n\nprint(\"Theme helper initialized.\")\n","Description":"Create base theme helper script with slate gray and yellow palette","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\<user>\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\\scratch\\render_classic_design_flowcharts.py","toolAction":"Writing classic theme helper script","toolSummary":"Write classic theme script"}}]}
